[{"title":"步杨台觉上座静空题朱秀峰前韵","author":"张家玉","text":"结宇长依朱秀峰，霏霏珠翠滴玲珑。\n烟霞不捲新朝露，岁月常悬旧日容。\n封作狼山一块石，标成铜柱万年功。\n撑持半壁君同我，肯逐恒河浪寄踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵曲六章 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"迢迢邗江道，烟花咫尺迷。\n朱楼临紫陌，画舫接金堤。\n隐隐闻歌吹，相传是竹西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵曲六章 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"五方推利薮，到处是膻场。\n夜市千灯艳，春醪十里香。\n豪华感行路，知道是盐行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵曲六章 其三","author":"张家玉","text":"新莺初学啭，乳燕正交飞。\n芳草青丝发，垂杨金缕衣。\n昔日迷楼下，家家拥翠帏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵曲六章 其四","author":"张家玉","text":"琼瑶天下种，桃李路傍枝。\n憨爱司花女，娇怜来梦儿。\n奔月何时下，为云未可知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵曲六章 其五","author":"张家玉","text":"逶迤锦步障，乱转七香车。\n尘暗九衢月，光生满路花。\n何因堕珠泪，言过玉钩斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵曲六章 其六","author":"张家玉","text":"悄悄搴帏出，盈盈却扇行。\n衣裳秋水染，笑语香风生。\n却向琼花观，低头礼玉清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻嘉祐寺","author":"张家玉","text":"英英白云懒，杳杳青溪暮。\n山僧不出门，残钟在深树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛月 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"沿月纵兰桡，江烟碧未消。\n清波不相待，转盼失溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛月 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"澄江净于练，归人浩思发。\n不信捲帘人，相思有明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"扶娇下绣帏，与郎玉相映。\n欲窥燕尾妆，镜前重引镜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"去年笑参商，今年咏鸳鸯。\n愿郎结同心，勿复生他肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题真州寄园四首 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"水榭茅堂分峙，溪桥石磴相连。\n记得春山深处，丹崖碧洞依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题真州寄园四首 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"莫怪愚公移山，信有神人鞭石。\n请看一片平芜，幻出数峰秋碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题真州寄园四首 其三","author":"张家玉","text":"红树山亭自远，落花一卷无尘。\n鸡犬不知有汉，鱼鸟自来亲人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题真州寄园四首 其四","author":"张家玉","text":"古道近通杨子，名园直偶辟疆。\n借问竹西歌吹，何如花下壶觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"津亭","author":"张家玉","text":"鱼子津亭牵客衣，为言前路去船稀。\n野云渡水迷江树，飞鸟萧条带雨归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江夜月 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"霜满空林红叶稀，捲篷秋露欲沾衣。\n水鸟夜寒栖不定，双双偏掠客船飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江夜月 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"前村烟暝几人家，归客扁舟泊浅沙。\n隔岸渔灯乍明灭，满船凉月湿芦花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涌汀晚泊","author":"张家玉","text":"孤棹乘流晚更过，半溪烟暝起渔歌。\n老翁不管关心事，自在船头织绿蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家少参署中早梅","author":"张家玉","text":"春暖南枝早亚衙，半枝疏影上窗纱。\n故园今夜三更月，香发罗浮几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过永淳","author":"张家玉","text":"古渡荒城瞰碧天，茑萝斜挂夕阳烟。\n寒溪不断流今古，枫叶辞秋过客船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"张家玉","text":"玉笛飞声满客城，东风吹送故园情。\n梅花乱落人何处，唯见关山碎月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别李烟客","author":"张家玉","text":"扁舟随雁出枫林，回首禅房积翠深。\n自笑尘缘消未得，赠君惟有白云心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过曲江谒先文献祠 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"曲江山翠郁巑岏，万古千秋祖烈存。\n金鉴至今称国宝，岂惟勋业擅开元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过曲江谒先文献祠 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"明烛几先有远图，可怜风度至今无。\n催花羯鼓声方闹，早向渔阳识叛胡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居五首 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"卜筑蓬蒿一径斜，池塘新绿映窗纱。\n蒲团坐到忘机处，不觉春风度落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居五首 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"萧萧夜雨拂窗蓬，弱草柔条怯晚风。\n却怪南园数竿竹，亦随风动委池中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居五首 其三","author":"张家玉","text":"小园春暖日芳菲，画阁摊书懒下帷。\n求友黄鹂满深树，山童不用款柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居五首 其四","author":"张家玉","text":"丹崖碧洞锁柴扉，中有真人学息机。\n却笑白云行不得，风来又过别山飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居五首 其五","author":"张家玉","text":"风摇万绿昼阴阴，双屐穿花不染尘。\n记得断桥流水畔，虬枝时伴一溪云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀内二首 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"闺中昨日起离愁，杨柳青青送客舟。\n今夕凄凉又何处，半帆烟雨楚江秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"军中遗稿 读史十首 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"读史高斋日正红，书生予夺笑谈中。\n帝秦不是奇男子，也有强梁向海东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"军中遗稿 读史十首 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"汉使堂堂出朔边，微茫海北锁寒烟。\n青羝白雪如逢我，耐得苏卿十九年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"军中遗稿 读史十首 其三","author":"张家玉","text":"顺水长驱事已非，龙潜虎伏失干旂。\n南阳果系真天子，定有王丰勒马归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"军中遗稿 读史十首 其四","author":"张家玉","text":"宣阳门外汉重围，日落华林掩夕晖。\n国破家亡今古事，肯随会稽着青衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"军中遗稿 读史十首 其六","author":"张家玉","text":"渔阳鼙鼓动燕京，若个传来骂贼声。\n记得当年颜太守，洛阳桥畔舌纵横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"tit