,"text":"瘦马崎岖不肯前，天涯飘泊苦烽烟。\n何时范蠡功成去，泛泛沧江一小船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"凛烈寒威战碧苍，萧萧原野尽荒凉。\n秾桃嫩李纷零落，独看青松不避霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其三","author":"张家玉","text":"马上看山叠叠青，青山无地不膻腥。\n谁堪满目苍凉处，俯仰兴思一涕零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其四","author":"张家玉","text":"灯下娇姬月下弦，风流曾泛太湖船。\n于今回首神京处，肠断西风忆往年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38739,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其五","author":"张家玉","text":"云净天空朔气寒，举头何处是长安。\n那堪几点孤臣泪，洒向枫林带血看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其六","author":"张家玉","text":"缥缈疏林在隔山，数声鸡犬白云间。\n潆洄一带寒溪浅，疑是秦人避此间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其七","author":"张家玉","text":"家藏三略已烟消，勋业谁当比汉朝。\n遥忆仙人遗履处，几回翘首望圯桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中八绝 其八","author":"张家玉","text":"高风曾见几人称，纲纪先朝久已倾。\n独有南还陈太史，文章节义两留名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38743,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将发","author":"张家玉","text":"东泊西飘寄一身，头颅空带楚冠尘。\n千秋独有文夫子，同笑迎降卖国人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38744,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶闻童仆夜语","author":"张家玉","text":"不达时情数蠢奴，犹思家业苦嗟吁。\n此身已置存亡外，宁计田芜与地芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38745,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"痛悼先茔被发","author":"张家玉","text":"庐室空馀一炬灰，祖骸仍暴委蒿莱。\n可怜忠孝难兼尽，血洒西风寄夜台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38746,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早行河源","author":"张家玉","text":"野外燐飞闪闪明，奇鸧相叫互悲声。\n沙场满眼英雄骨，独有流波咽不平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38747,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"张家玉","text":"拟卜幽居绝世尘，桃源无路可逃秦。\n朝来怕纵潇潇目，愁见青山换主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38748,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追昔","author":"张家玉","text":"内苑曾推盖世豪，花砖睡起日轮高。\n如今转忆宸游地，羞见承恩旧汉袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38749,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻鸡","author":"张家玉","text":"恼梦初惊月落时，鸡声错听赴朝仪。\n鹓班散处彤墀晏，记得承恩退食迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38750,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺寓兴 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"关塞迢迢万里赊，红颜多少老风沙。\n祇图肘后黄金印，误掷人间几岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38751,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺寓兴 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"竹林啼鸟送春晖，何事行人尚未归。\n惆怅夜来窗月白，梦魂飞不到金微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38752,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺寓兴 其三","author":"张家玉","text":"春病春愁两不宽，愁连烽火是长安。\n何时得起龙城将，早向阴山解战鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38753,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒大司马袁自如先生遗祠","author":"张家玉","text":"司马遗忠尚有祠，重来客泪洒荒碑。\n长城借得先生在，肯致中原苦乱离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38754,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读于忠悯杨椒山两公行录不觉拍案","author":"张家玉","text":"前有于兮后有杨，须眉男子两堂堂。\n全忠自古难全孝，何况家亡与国亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38755,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓目怆怀","author":"张家玉","text":"三十无成荏苒过，眼前羞见旧山河。\n人民城郭皆非昔，怪得文山感慨多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38756,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马上感叹 其一","author":"张家玉","text":"戎马奔忙日易斜，风尘荏苒一长嗟。\n荒村寥落炊烟绝，愁听垂杨噪暮鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38757,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马上感叹 其二","author":"张家玉","text":"郊原缭绕暗戈兵，笳鼓声悲惨客情。\n心折几回翘首望，路迷何处是西京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38758,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"军中夜感","author":"张家玉","text":"惨澹天昏与地荒，西风残月冷沙场。\n裹尸马革英雄事，纵死终令汗竹香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38759,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得萧年兄西京大捷之札志喜","author":"张家玉","text":"微臣忽报复西京，举手良深舞蹈情。\n万国戎师今四集，九天威福正中兴。\n蔡城再见鹅鸣捷，淝水重闻鹤唳惊。\n早晚贤王应授首，长驱还拟扫龙庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38760,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨","author":"张家玉","text":"欹枕更残夜正深，凄风苦雨助哀吟。\n蓼莪忍诵思亲句，犬马难忘报主心。\n望断江关愁极目，梦回京国涕沾襟。\n离离禾黍添新恨，何日西归得好音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38761,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"张家玉","text":"蓬窗独坐气飕飕，击楫谁怜士雅忧。\n撒手已无儿女恋，回头宁有室家谋。\n须知白水仍兴汉，未信西戎可继周。\n惆怅胡尘思欲扫，几回中夜舞吴钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38762,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨行马上纵目山川怆然追念余祖九龄公至宋世杰公皆孤忠表表凛然万古","author":"张家玉","text":"处处汹汹苦战征，炎方烽火几时平。\n雨声遍洒孤臣泪，风景空怜异代情。\n国破匈奴千古恨，心悬明主一身轻。\n唐朝宋室家声在，肯使吾曹落后名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38763,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]